  \caption{An exact three-dimensional example of Kim's connectedness
    construction \cite[Section~2]{Kim}, with panels scaled separately.
    (a) The two input cubes meet only at a corner.
    (b) The eight colors identify the pieces $30x_i+Q'_i$ of $S_2$.
    (c) Blue and orange identify its two translated copies in
